.TH AVR\-STATUS 1 "" "avr 0.1.3" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-status \- Show recent runs, performance stats, and cache health.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr status
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show recent runs, performance stats, and cache health.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted.
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fITEXT\fR
Time window for stats panels: '7d', '24h', etc. (default: 7d)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output raw JSON.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-run (1),
.BR avr-job (1),
.BR avr-workflow (1),
.BR avr-cache (1),
.BR avr-log (1),
.BR avr-auth (1),
.BR avr-config (1),
.BR avr-settings (1),
.BR avr-firewall (1),
.BR avr-billing (1),
.BR avr-audit-events (1),
.BR avr-repo (1),
.BR avr-org (1),
.BR avr-health (1)
